    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I view math as a practical tool rather than a pure abstraction. My lower secondary education gave me foundational skills, but I’m more comfortable applying it to real-world problems like budgeting or understanding chemistry concepts. It’s not my strongest subject, but I find it useful when connected to tangible tasks.",
