    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used a math-solving app to check my homework. It helped me understand steps I missed, like simplifying fractions. The app was intuitive but sometimes gave overly complex solutions that confused me. Overall, it was a good supplement but not a replacement for practice.",
