    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can personalize learning by adapting to individual student needs, like explaining concepts in simple terms or generating practice problems. They can also provide instant feedback on homework, helping students identify mistakes early. This makes math more engaging and less intimidating for beginners."
